Z||000015||My7Fieros||12-29-2001||09:23 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by gargoyle:<BR><B>First let me state that this is NOT meant as a flame! You know, I guess I just don't get it. What is it about Indys that drives everybody to get so emotional. They are really just another one of GMs sticker cars. You know, some special paint, a few stickers here and there and ta da, it's a "special edition" Now maybe if they had some of the same goodies as the "real" Indys I might be impressed. Also, the interior reminds me of a candy cane, red carpet & white seats, YUK. Somebody got a hold of some bad drugs for that one. That would be the first thing to go if I had one and next would be the stickers. Remember, this is not meant as a flame, it's just my opinion. No doubt some of you don't particularly like my silver 87 GT either.</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><BR>No offense taken. Actually I pretty much agree. I always called the Indy interior the "Elvis" interior lol. But since Im sooo into Fieros, and had the opportunity to get one, I figured "why not", ya know? I've grown to really like it though...<BR>Oh, and btw, Ive got a silver 87 Gt, cant go wrong w/ that!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><P>||||reg||1
